{"question": "请帮我判断远程办公审批路线，我还没有提供员工类别和每周天数，请先确认。
User reply: 我在试用期，每周只申请一天。", "answerable": true, "reference_answer": "Probationary employee needs HR approval even for one remote day.", "gold_evidence": [{"document_id": "428da73a353c42cab5f263ee9faaf873", "page": 7, "text": "REMOTE-26 current remote work policy: Regular employees may request up to two remote days per week with team lead confirmation. Requests above two days require an HR exception approval. Probationary staff require HR approval even for one day. A schedule does not constitute approval."}], "answer": "根据你自报的试用期身份和每周申请一天远程办公的情况，当前政策要求即使只申请一天也须获得HR批准；该判断以你的自报为条件，最终以HR批准为准。 [1] [5]

排班安排本身不构成远程办公批准。 [1]"}
